cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ontology for the Astronomical Knowledge Ecosystem"
message: "If you use OAKE in your work, please cite this repository."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Piel
    given-names: Steven
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1759-5254"

repository-code: "https://github.com/spiel-ifremer/oake"

license: "CC-BY-4.0"

abstract: >
  OAKE (Ontology for the Astronomical Knowledge Ecosystem)
  provides a semantic foundation for describing, integrating
  and connecting the worldwide astronomy ecosystem, including
  professional astronomy, amateur astronomy, citizen science,
  observing infrastructures, organisations, instruments,
  services, knowledge resources and scientific activities.

keywords:
  - astronomy
  - ontology
  - semantic web
  - knowledge graph
  - linked data
  - FAIR
  - open science
  - RDF
  - OWL
  - astronomy ontology
